# ChangeDetection.io Docker Environment Variables

# Web UI Port
CHANGEDETECTION_PORT=5000

# User/Group IDs
PUID=1000
PGID=1000

# Browser Configuration
# Maximum concurrent browser instances for JavaScript rendering
MAX_BROWSERS=4

# Playwright Integration
# ======================
# The sockpuppetbrowser container provides full JavaScript rendering.
# This allows ChangeDetection to monitor modern JS-heavy websites
# that simple HTML scraping would miss.

# First Run
# =========
# 1. Access http://localhost:5000
# 2. Add your first watch (URL to monitor)
# 3. Configure check frequency
# 4. Set up notifications (optional)
